{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 36, :comments ["<b>Those of you who are left.</b> Because he said, \"and I will send the sword after you\"." "<b>מורך</b> [faintness]: a noun with a doubled stem, like <b>במועל</b> in \"their hand was remiss\" [Joshua], from the root of <b>ורך הלבב</b> [\"and faint of heart\"]. And they will fear until a driven leaf's sound pursues them. It is an adjective in the nif'al pattern, and the root letter nun is latent."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:12:50.829219845Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}